(text "USB data / SBU intentionally unused.\nDP and DM short only at U1 (PD-only).\nR2 requests 9 V; 5 V is housekeeping only." (at 22.86 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid "126421b9-4e56-5ef1-839b-42dee03814f6"))
(text "UV / OV dividers return to RTN, NOT GND.\nNominal rising window: 7.878 .. 10.781 V.\nR8: 0.2985 A nominal limit, not a guaranteed rating.\nPG + window does NOT prove a 9 V PDO/current contract." (at 281.94 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "8e940ada-6e78-51d6-9e51-5d940ccc9d56"))
(text "PG low -> Q1 on -> series RUN -> SHDN high.\nDefault RUN OPEN; R30 defaults SHDN low.\nR31 bleeds VPROT; zero residual voltage is NOT guaranteed." (at 170.18 223.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "82e951f7-c650-50af-ba81-b18fe6a8c25e"))
(text "No qualified VBUS / CC ESD or surge protection. D1 is absent.\nAll converter bulk is downstream of U2. See design-review.md." (at 22.86 220.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "fe9db631-3221-5683-b203-33e67c55d425"))
